Package: bande-dict-en
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Enhances: bande-lookup
Description: English dictionary and thesaurus for Dictionary (Open English WordNet)
 The English Dictionary and the English Thesaurus of Open English WordNet
 2025, converted to the pack format that Bande's Dictionary and Look Up
 read from /usr/share/bande/dict.

Package: bande-dict-en-wiktionary
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Enhances: bande-lookup
Description: English words from Wiktionary for Dictionary
 The English words of Wiktionary, extracted by kaikki.org, converted to the
 pack format that Bande's Dictionary and Look Up read from
 /usr/share/bande/dict. Dictionary leaves it off until it is turned on in
 its settings.

Package: bande-dict-sv
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Enhances: bande-lookup
Description: Swedish-English dictionary and Swedish thesaurus for Dictionary
 Folkets lexikon, the Swedish-English dictionary of KTH, and Synlex, its
 Swedish thesaurus, converted to the pack format that Bande's Dictionary and
 Look Up read from /usr/share/bande/dict.

Package: bande-dict-sv-wiktionary
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Enhances: bande-lookup
Description: Swedish words from Wiktionary for Dictionary
 The Swedish words of Wiktionary, extracted by kaikki.org, with their
 English definitions, converted to the pack format that Bande's Dictionary
 and Look Up read from /usr/share/bande/dict.
